---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const patreonUrl = 'https://patreon.com/BrianReymore';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support This Work"
  description="Support independent essays on power, conscience, institutional drift, civic responsibility, and moral courage."
>
  <main class="prose reading support-page">
    <div class="kicker">Support</div>

    <h1>Help sustain serious work for serious times.</h1>

    <p>
      BrianReymore.com is built around long-form essays on power,
      conscience, institutional drift, civic responsibility, moral
      courage, and the slow erosion of what deserves to endure.
    </p>

    <p>
      The work here is intentionally public whenever possible.
      Thoughtful civic writing should not be hidden from the very
      people who may need it most. But serious work still takes time.
    </p>

    <p>
      Research takes time. Writing takes time. Revision takes time.
      Refusal takes time. Building a space where thoughtful people can
      gather without surrendering to noise, outrage, or ideological
      capture takes time.
    </p>

    <p>
      If these essays matter to you, and you want to help sustain
      independent long-form thinking, civic inquiry, public witness,
      and future community work, you can support the project on Patreon.
    </p>

    <div class="support-card">
      <h2>Support on Patreon</h2>

      <p>
        Patreon support helps sustain the public essays, reader
        submissions, civic research, discussion spaces, and future
        projects moving forward.
      </p>

      <p>
        This is not a paywall around conscience. It is a way for
        those who can help to strengthen the work for everyone.
      </p>

      <a
        class="button primary"
        href={patreonUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Support This Work on Patreon
      </a>
    </div>

    <p>
      Whether you support financially, submit something thoughtful,
      join the conversation, or simply read carefully:
      thank you.
    </p>

    <p>
      Serious societies require serious witness. This is one small
      attempt to keep that witness alive.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
